{"seq":2,"slug":"awq-smoothquant","title":"AWQ 与 SmoothQuant","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/techniques/awq-smoothquant","wordCount":1432,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"awq-与-smoothquant\">AWQ 与 SmoothQuant</h1><p>GPTQ 的思路是「量化后补救误差」，而 AWQ 和 SmoothQuant 反其道而行：在量化之前先动手术，让权重和激活变得「天生好量化」，于是量化本身可以又快又简单。两者都靠一个逐通道的缩放变换，但目标不同——AWQ 保护少数关键权重通道以做好仅权重量化，SmoothQuant 迁移激活异常值难度以做好 W8A8 激活量化。这一篇把这对「缩放派」技术讲清楚，它们正是 <a href=\"../methods/outlier-handling\">异常值与混合精度</a> 里「疏」与「保护重要值」两条思路的具体兑现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-缩放等价变换\">核心概念：缩放等价变换</h2><p>AWQ 和 SmoothQuant 共享一个数学基础：对线性层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = XW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，插入一个逐通道的对角缩放矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>diag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{diag}(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 及其逆，乘积保持不变：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>diag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>diag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = XW = \\big(X \\cdot \\text{diag}(s)^{-1}\\big)\\big(\\text{diag}(s) \\cdot W\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个变换不改变任何输出，却能重新分配「量化难度」——把缩放因子选得当，就能让激活或权重变得更适合低比特表示。区别在于两者用它来达成不同目的，下表对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>AWQ</th>\n<th>SmoothQuant</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量化目标</td>\n<td>仅权重 W4A16</td>\n<td>权重+激活 W8A8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩放方向</td>\n<td>放大重要权重通道</td>\n<td>缩小激活异常通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解决的问题</td>\n<td>4 比特下保护关键权重</td>\n<td>激活异常值毒化范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>GPU 解码、小批量</td>\n<td>大批量、计算受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"awq-1-的权重决定成败\">AWQ：1% 的权重决定成败</h2><p>AWQ（Activation-aware Weight Quantization，激活感知权重量化）的出发点是一个实验观察：并非所有权重同等重要，保护其中约 1% 的「关键权重」就能大幅减少量化损失。而判断哪些权重关键的依据，不是权重本身的大小，而是<strong>流经它们的激活的幅度</strong>——大激活所乘的权重通道，对输出影响最大，量化误差被放大得最厉害。</p>\n<p>但直接把这 1% 权重留成 FP16 会破坏硬件友好的规整格式（又回到混合精度的麻烦）。AWQ 的巧思是改用缩放代替混合精度：给关键权重通道乘一个大于 1 的缩放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（同时把对应激活除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 保持等价）。放大后的权重在量化时占据更多有效比特、相对量化误差变小，等于「不动格式、只调数值」地保护了它们。缩放因子按各通道的激活幅度统计自动搜索，全程只需 <a href=\"../methods/calibration\">校准</a> 数据跑一遍前向，不需要反向传播、不需要 Hessian。</p>\n<p>据 AWQ 的报告和 2026 年的评测，它在 4 比特仅权重量化上质量与 GPTQ 相当甚至更好，而量化过程更快、对校准集不过拟合，且产出的格式在 GPU 上能高效执行，在边缘 GPU 上实现 3 倍以上加速。这让 AWQ 成为 2026 年 GPU 端 4 比特部署的热门默认选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"smoothquant-把异常值难度迁移给权重\">SmoothQuant：把异常值难度迁移给权重</h2><p>SmoothQuant 解决的是另一个问题——激活量化。如 <a href=\"../methods/outlier-handling\">异常值与混合精度</a> 所述，LLM 激活有系统性异常值，朴素 W8A8 会让输出近乎随机。SmoothQuant 用同一个缩放变换，但方向相反：给激活异常通道<strong>除以</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 压下去，给权重对应通道<strong>乘以</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 担起来。</p>\n<p>关键是缩放因子怎么选才能两边都好量化。SmoothQuant 用激活和权重各自逐通道最大值的几何平衡，引入一个迁移强度超参 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mi>α</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_j = \\frac{\\big(\\max_i |X_{ij}|\\big)^{\\alpha}}{\\big(\\max_i |W_{ij}|\\big)^{1-\\alpha}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9383em;vertical-align:-1.294em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6443em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.054em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.284em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.054em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.794em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.054em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.294em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 控制把多少难度从激活搬到权重：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 偏大，激活被压得更平、但权重负担重；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 偏小则相反。典型取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>，让两边难度大致均衡。这个变换是离线一次完成的，推理时是规整的稠密 W8A8 矩阵乘，对硬件极友好。据报告，SmoothQuant 让 OPT-175B 等模型的 W8A8 接近无损，带来最高约 1.56 倍加速和 2 倍显存节省。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[线性层 Y=XW] --&gt; B[插入缩放 diag s 等价变换]&#10;  B --&gt; C{目标?}&#10;  C --&gt;|仅权重 W4A16| D[AWQ]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[按激活幅度找1%关键权重通道]&#10;  D1 --&gt; D2[关键通道权重 乘 s 放大]&#10;  D2 --&gt; D3[量化4比特 关键权重误差变小]&#10;  C --&gt;|权重+激活 W8A8| E[SmoothQuant]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[激活异常通道 除 s 压平]&#10;  E1 --&gt; E2[权重对应通道 乘 s 担起]&#10;  E2 --&gt; E3[两边都好量化 W8A8可用]\">flowchart TD\n  A[线性层 Y=XW] --&gt; B[插入缩放 diag s 等价变换]\n  B --&gt; C{目标?}\n  C --&gt;|仅权重 W4A16| D[AWQ]\n  D --&gt; D1[按激活幅度找1%关键权重通道]\n  D1 --&gt; D2[关键通道权重 乘 s 放大]\n  D2 --&gt; D3[量化4比特 关键权重误差变小]\n  C --&gt;|权重+激活 W8A8| E[SmoothQuant]\n  E --&gt; E1[激活异常通道 除 s 压平]\n  E1 --&gt; E2[权重对应通道 乘 s 担起]\n  E2 --&gt; E3[两边都好量化 W8A8可用]</pre><h2 id=\"二者与-gptq-的关系\">二者与 GPTQ 的关系</h2><p>AWQ、SmoothQuant 和 <a href=\"gptq\">GPTQ</a> 不是三选一的竞品，而是覆盖不同维度的工具。GPTQ 和 AWQ 都做仅权重 4 比特，常被放在一起比：GPTQ 靠误差补偿、量化慢但成熟，AWQ 靠激活感知缩放、量化快且对校准鲁棒，二者质量在 4 比特相当，实践中常根据工具链支持二选一。SmoothQuant 则正交——它做的是激活量化（W8A8），目标是大批量计算受限场景，可以和权重量化叠加用（如 W4A8）。</p>\n<p>下表把三者放进 <a href=\"../foundations/quantization-spectrum\">量化谱系</a> 的坐标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>核心手段</th>\n<th>量化速度</th>\n<th>主战场</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPTQ</td>\n<td>W4A16</td>\n<td>Hessian 误差补偿</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>GPU 解码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWQ</td>\n<td>W4A16</td>\n<td>激活感知缩放</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>GPU 解码、边缘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SmoothQuant</td>\n<td>W8A8</td>\n<td>异常值迁移缩放</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>大批量推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AWQ 和 SmoothQuant 共享缩放等价变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>diag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>diag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XW=(X\\,\\text{diag}(s)^{-1})(\\text{diag}(s)\\,W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，靠重分配量化难度做到「量化前先变好量化」。</li>\n<li>AWQ 按激活幅度识别约 1% 关键权重通道、用缩放放大保护它们，做仅权重 4 比特，量化快、对校准鲁棒、GPU 友好。</li>\n<li>SmoothQuant 把激活异常通道除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、权重乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，由超参 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（典型 0.5）控制迁移强度，让 W8A8 激活量化从崩溃变可用。</li>\n<li>三者关系：GPTQ 与 AWQ 同做 W4A16 可二选一，SmoothQuant 做 W8A8 与权重量化正交、可叠加成 W4A8。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上游 <a href=\"../methods/outlier-handling\">异常值与混合精度</a>：本篇是其「疏」与「保护重要值」思路的算法实现。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"gptq\">GPTQ</a>：对照「量化后补偿」与「量化前缩放」两条路线。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/systems/quantization-tensorrt\">推理系统 · TensorRT 量化</a> 看 W8A8/W4A8 在生产引擎中的内核支持。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AWQ 与 SmoothQuant","id":"awq-与-smoothquant"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：缩放等价变换","id":"核心概念-缩放等价变换"},{"level":2,"text":"AWQ：1% 的权重决定成败","id":"awq-1-的权重决定成败"},{"level":2,"text":"SmoothQuant：把异常值难度迁移给权重","id":"smoothquant-把异常值难度迁移给权重"},{"level":2,"text":"二者与 GPTQ 的关系","id":"二者与-gptq-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"GPTQ 逐层量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/techniques/gptq"},"next":{"title":"GGUF 与 llama.cpp","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/techniques/gguf-llamacpp"}}